		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Shadowy silhouette of a buxom woman with black butterfly wings filled with stars. Embodies the void between worlds.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16, <strong>HP</strong> 78, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 dagger (close/near) +9 (1d4+3) or 1 steal breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +6, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 16</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Avatar</strong>. Only damaged by magic sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Move Between</strong>. While moving, teleport to any point she can see.</p><p></p><p><strong>Starflight</strong>. Empyreal and those accompanying her can survive the interstellar void. Able to fly between worlds in 1d4 days.</p><p></p><p><strong>Steal Breath</strong>. One creature within close, CON 18+ or unconscious for 1d4 hours.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
